        "TileImage": "$($repository f0c2e483-89fe-40c5-bb4a-beacf9a07feb).Image",
        "Description": "To topple paramilitary control of this town, your first target will be the headquarters of the cartel in-town. You will have to take out the first two guards, what you do with Andrea is up to you. Then, you will have to launch an offensive at the mansion, and execute Hector Delgado, and taking Rico. The final piece of this plan lays in the jungles, where the remaining (weakened) forces will be. Take control of the jungle, execute the lab engineers, and cement your control over Santa Fortuna.",
